    {
      "text": "A high-tech key that has to be used at a specific\nlocation. It emits a special electronic signal to open\na door.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "決まった　場所で　使うことで\n特殊な　電気信号を　だして\n扉を　開ける　ハイテクな　カギ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在特定的地方使用，\n就会发出特殊电信号\n来开门的高科技钥匙。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una llave de alta tecnología que debe usarse en un\nlugar concreto. Emite una señal eléctrica que abre una\npuerta.",
